# Craftmake downsample fixtures (committed reference fixtures).
# Keep at the end so these negations win over the generic *.bam/*.bai/*.fastq rules above.
# The FASTQ fixtures are committed because the offline rehearsal reads them by default. The
# BAM fixtures are deliberately not committed: nothing in this repository consumes them, and
# they are reproducible build output of scripts/craftmake-downsample-fixtures.sh.
!testdata/gate6/craftmake-downsample-20260906/
!testdata/gate6/craftmake-downsample-20260906/**
!testdata/gate6/craftmake-downsample-20260906/**/*.fastq.gz
!testdata/gate6/craftmake-downsample-20260906/**/*.json
testdata/gate6/craftmake-downsample-20260906/bam/

